ight changes (verified during earlier tests: toggling competency changed critical path from 3 to 5 instantly; simulation scenarios changed critical path from 3 to 5 to 4 in real-time). Critical path values reflect enabled competencies only, changes are synchronized with metrics.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CT-17\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Recruitment simulation lowered Technical and Domain levels (-1) via scenario adjustments. System Design (high-weight competency) fell below recommended level, immediately created risk-gap warning. The gap alert appeared naming System Design as affected competency.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CT-18\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Gap alert visible: 'Competency Gap Alert 1 competency below recommended level: System Design. Consider increasing training focus or adjusting expectations.' Alert names affected competency and provides corrective action suggestion, displayed prominently in metrics region.\"}]}"
